        "title": "Polling",
        "description": "The minimum poll interval for this setup is {minimum} s. Changing the maximum gap is an advanced setting: it only changes how unused addresses are bridged, never what is written (nothing is). Writing: when enabled, a target set in Home Assistant is sent as one wheel register to the selected zones only, at the start of the next poll, and shown once confirmed by the following read. Nothing is written otherwise.",
